<span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area（寫出完整計算過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>把 0.5 化成Fraction（最簡形式）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>把 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 化成Decimal</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>計算 0.25 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = ？（提示：先統一格式）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>計算 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> × 0.2 = ？（提示：統一格式再乘）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>判斷：<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + 0.5 應該先轉Fraction還是先轉Decimal？為甚麼？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Fraction與Decimal混合Addition — 先統一格式的策略<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <strong>核心原則</strong>：Fraction和Decimal不能直接相加！必須先統一格式<br/>
      ② <strong>策略一（轉Fraction法）</strong>：把Decimal化成Fraction → 通分 → 計算 → 約簡。適用於：Decimal可化成簡單Fraction時（0.5, 0.25, 0.75, 0.2, 0.125等）<br/>
      ③ <strong>策略二（轉Decimal法）</strong>：把Fraction化成Decimal → 對齊Decimal點 → 計算。適用於：Fraction可化成有限Decimal時（分母為 2,4,5,8,10,20,25...）<br/>
      ④ <strong>選擇策略的關鍵</strong>：看哪個轉換結果更簡潔。分母為 3,6,7,9 通常→轉Fraction；分母為 2,4,5,8 可→轉Decimal
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 Trap引爆例題（本堂最重要的示範）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算：<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + 0.5 = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake（60% 學生）</div><div class="eq">0.25 + 0.5 = 0.3 （Decimal點對錯位）</div><div class="why">直接把 0.25 和 0.5 的十分位對錯，誤算為 0.25+0.05=0.3</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法（轉Fraction法）</div><div class="eq"><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span></div><div class="why">0.5 = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> → <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「格式不齊先統一，分母3/6/7/9轉Fraction，分母2/4/5/8可Decimal，答案要最簡」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最高頻錯誤：Fraction和Decimal不經轉換就直接相加，把分子加Decimal當答案</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 第二高頻錯誤：Decimal點對位錯誤——十分位要對十分位，百分位要對百分位</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 Worked Examples（寫出統一格式 → 計算過程）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例1</td><td>0.75 + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例2</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + 0.2 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 + KP3 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：Fraction與Decimal混合乘除<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>混合乘除策略：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>推薦策略：全部轉Fraction</strong>——Decimal化Fraction後，用FractionMultiplication（分子乘分子、分母乘分母），最後約簡<br/>
      ② Division：轉Fraction後「÷ Fraction = × 倒數」<br/>
      ③ 若轉Decimal：注意DecimalMultiplication的Decimal位數規則（a位×b位= a+b位Decimal）<br/>
      ④ <strong>關鍵判斷</strong>：若Decimal是循環Decimal（如 0.333...），必須轉Fraction處理
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題（Trap示範）</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例3：<span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × 0.5 = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例4：0.75 ÷ <span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> × 0.8 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>0.6 × <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> ÷ 0.25 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>0.4 ÷ <span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × 0.125 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：四則混合中的Fraction＋Decimal（先乘除後加減 ＋ 格式統一）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 進階</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>混合四則策略（雙重挑戰）：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>第一步：遵守運算順序</strong>——先乘除、後加減，有括號先算括號<br/>
      ② <strong>第二步：分段統一格式</strong>——乘除部分統一轉Fraction處理，加減部分再決定轉Fraction或Decimal<br/>
      ③ <strong>推薦整體策略</strong>：全部轉Fraction最安全（避免Decimal除不盡的問題）<br/>
      ④ 若有括號且括號內含Fraction＋Decimal：先處理括號內格式統一
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例5：0.5 + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × 0.6 = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例6：(<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + 0.25) × <span class="fd"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>0.3 + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × 0.4 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td><span class="fd"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × 0.75 + 0.25 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: TIERED PRACTICE ═══════════════ -->
<div>
