<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 5: KP4 APPLICATION ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：跨課題Word Problems（購物折扣 ＋ 食譜份量 ＋ 工程測量）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>解題四步法：</strong>① <strong>圈關鍵詞</strong>（「一共」「折扣後」「每份」）② <strong>列式</strong>（Fraction和Decimal統一格式）③ <strong>計算</strong>（注意單位換算）④ <strong>寫完整答句</strong>（不寫答句扣步驟分！）
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例7：一個蛋糕原價 $80，現在打八折（即 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>）。小明有 0.6 個蛋糕的份量，他需要付多少元？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">Word Problems練習（全部必做，列式 → 統一格式 → 計算 → 答句）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>一支鉛筆 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> 元，小明買了 0.6 支（按比例計費）。他需要付多少元？（以Decimal作答）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td>食譜需要 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 公斤麵粉和 0.25 公斤糖。兩種材料共重多少公斤？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">32</td><td>一條絲帶長 2.5 米，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 做蝴蝶結。蝴蝶結用了多少米絲帶？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:78px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">進階Word Problems（🚶🚀 Optional，呈分試卷二常見題型）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">33</td><td>一件外套原價 $360，打七五折（0.75）。另外再用會員 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">10</span></span> 優惠券折上折。小明最終需付多少元？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">34</td><td>食譜：蛋糕需要 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 杯牛奶。如果只做 0.75 份（即 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 份），需要多少杯牛奶？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">35</td><td>工程隊一天完成工程的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>。0.5 天後，又完成了工程的 0.125。共完成了工程的幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">36</td><td>水樽原有水 0.75 升，喝了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 升，再加了 0.2 升。現在水樽有多少升？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、🏔️ 終極挑戰專區</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️1</td><td>(0.75 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>) ÷ (<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> − 0.25) × 1.2 = ？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️2</td><td>一個水缸容量為 5 升。第一次注入 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 缸的 0.8，第二次注入 1.25 升。現在缸內有多少升？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">🏔️3</td><td>三個商店：A店折扣為 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span>，B店折扣為 0.65，C店折扣為 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。哪間最便宜？請以計算證明。（提示：全部轉Decimal比較）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 6: HOMEWORK + ERROR SUMMARY ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、Homework</div>
<div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)題（共 6 題，每題必須混合Fraction與Decimal）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>0.5 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + 0.3 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> × 0.4 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>0.6 ÷ <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>0.3 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> × 0.4 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>一個水壺有 1.5 升水，用了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>。用了多少升水？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)題（共 3 題，🚀 Optional）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>(0.5 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>) × <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>比較 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> × 0.75 和 0.6 × <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> 哪個較大？相差多少？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:82px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H9</td><td>一件貨品 $240，先加價 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>（即 ×1.25），再打八五折（0.85）。最終售價是多少？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error</th><th>Correct Approach</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Fraction和Decimal不經轉換直接相加</strong>：0.5+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=1.5/3（胡亂合併）</td><td>先統一格式：全轉Fraction或全轉Decimal，再計算</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Decimal點對位錯誤</strong>：0.25+0.5=0.3</td><td>十分位對十分位，百分位對百分位，必要時補0</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Fraction轉Decimal時除不盡卻硬取近似值</strong></td><td>分母含 3,6,7,9 等 → 轉Fraction處理，不要轉Decimal</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>混合四則忽略「先乘除後加減」</strong></td><td>先圈出乘除部分，計算完再做加減</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>DecimalMultiplicationDecimal位數計錯</strong></td><td>a位×b位 = a+b位Decimal；積的Decimal部分末尾0要保留至定位後再決定去留</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>FractionDivision未轉倒數</strong></td><td>÷ Fraction = × 該Fraction的倒數（分子分母互換）</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Word Problems答案未寫單位或答句不完整</strong></td><td>必須寫「答：……」＋單位，否則扣步驟分</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="end-note">🪤 LF Academy · LF Academy · We don't teach math — we teach trap avoidance.。 · LF-P5-下-L30 v2</div>
